    <h1>Account &amp; Data Deletion</h1>
    <p class="updated">Ace Fuel Loyalty &middot; Last updated: 13 July 2026</p>

    <p>This page explains how to request deletion of your <strong>Ace Fuel Loyalty</strong> account and
    associated personal data, operated by <strong>thoughtbasics</strong>.</p>

    <h2>How to request deletion</h2>
    <p>Email us from, or quoting, the phone number or email address registered to the loyalty account,
    with the subject line &ldquo;Delete my account&rdquo;:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Email: <!--email_off--><a href="mailto:admin@thoughtbasics.com?subject=Delete%20my%20account">admin@thoughtbasics.com</a><!--/email_off--></li>
    </ul>
    <p>We will verify your identity against the loyalty account before processing the request. Loyalty
    account holders may also ask any staff member at the fuel station to submit a deletion request on
    their behalf.</p>

    <h2>What is deleted</h2>
    <p>On a verified request we delete the personal data tied to your loyalty account, including:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Name, email address, and phone number</li>
      <li>Loyalty membership identifier and points balance</li>
      <li>Vehicle / number-plate details</li>
      <li>Redemption and transaction history linked to your account</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What may be retained</h2>
    <p>We may retain a limited set of records where required by law (for example, financial and
    tax records of fuel transactions) for the period mandated by applicable regulations, after which the
    data is deleted or anonymised. Retained records are not used to re-identify or contact you for
    marketing.</p>

    <h2>Timeline</h2>
    <p>Verified deletion requests are processed within <strong>30 days</strong>. We will confirm by email
    once your data has been deleted.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p><strong>thoughtbasics</strong>
      <br>Email: <!--email_off--><a href="mailto:admin@thoughtbasics.com">admin@thoughtbasics.com</a><!--/email_off-->
      <br>See also our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

